- [x] **Verify final body order:** orientation → config → playbook-index
  → study-playbook → update-playbook → research-index. 12 markers, 6
  pairs.

- [x] **Verify migration succeeded:** run the parser test suite
  (`npm test` filtered to `parseBrainAide`) or call `aide_validate` on
  this repo's `.aide/config/brain.aide`. The migrated file must parse
  as `kind: "ok"` and the typed result must carry all six string keys
  (`orientation`, `config`, `playbookIndex`, `studyPlaybook`,
